<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Node.js Todo App - CI/CD Pipeline Demo</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        /* Todo App Section */
        .todo-section {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #667eea;
            display: inline-block;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        /* Input Section */
        .input-section {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        #todo-input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
            border: 2px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        #todo-input:focus {
            border-color: #667eea;
        }
        
        button {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        button:hover {
            background: #764ba2;
        }
        
        /* Todo List */
        .todo-list {
            list-style: none;
        }
        
        .todo-item {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        
        .todo-item:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            background: #e9ecef;
        }
        
        .delete-btn {
            background: #dc3545;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .delete-btn:hover {
            background: #c82333;
        }
        
        /* Workflow Section */
        .workflow-section {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        .workflow-section h2 {
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .workflow-diagram {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .workflow-step {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 120px;
        }
        
        .tech-stack {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .tech-badge {
            background: #e9ecef;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .developer {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .workflow-diagram {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Todo App Section -->
        <div class="todo-section">
            <h1>📝 Todo List Application</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Manage your tasks efficiently</div>
            
            <form action="/add" method="POST" class="input-section">
                <input type="text" id="todo-input" name="newtask" placeholder="Enter a new task..." required>
                <button type="submit">Add Task</button>
            </form>
            
            <ul class="todo-list">
                <% if (todolist && todolist.length > 0) { %>
                    <% for (let i = 0; i < todolist.length; i++) { %>
                        <li class="todo-item">
                            <span><%= todolist[i] %></span>
                            <a href="/delete/<%= i %>" class="delete-btn" onclick="return confirm('Delete this task?')">Delete</a>
                        </li>
                    <% } %>
                <% } else { %>
                    <li style="text-align: center; color: #999;">No tasks yet. Add one above!</li>
                <% } %>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Workflow Section -->
        <div class="workflow-section">
            <h2>🔄 CI/CD Pipeline Workflow</h2>
            <div class="workflow-diagram">
                <div class="workflow-step">📝 Code Push<br><small>(GitHub)</small></div>
                <div class="workflow-step">🔨 Docker Build<br><small>(Local/CI)</small></div>
                <div class="workflow-step">📦 Push to Registry<br><small>(Docker Hub)</small></div>
                <div class="workflow-step">🚀 Auto Deploy<br><small>(Render)</small></div>
                <div class="workflow-step">🌐 Live App<br><small>(Public URL)</small></div>
            </div>
            
            <h3>🛠️ Technologies Used</h3>
            <div class="tech-stack">
                <span class="tech-badge">Node.js</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Express.js</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Docker</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Docker Hub</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Git & GitHub</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Render (PaaS)</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">EJS Templates</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">JavaScript</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3>📋 How It Works</h3>
            <ol style="margin-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>Developer</strong> pushes code to GitHub (local-dev branch)</li>
                <li><strong>Render</strong> automatically detects the change via webhook</li>
                <li><strong>Docker image</strong> is built from the Dockerfile</li>
                <li><strong>Container</strong> is deployed on Render's infrastructure</li>
                <li><strong>App</strong> becomes live at the public URL</li>
                <li><strong>Every git push</strong> triggers auto-deployment (CI/CD)</li>
            </ol>
            
            <h3>🏗️ AWS Alternative Mapping</h3>
            <div class="tech-stack">
                <span class="tech-badge">ECR → Docker Hub</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">ECS → Render</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">EC2 → Managed by Render</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">CloudWatch → Render Logs</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">IAM → GitHub OAuth</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="developer">
                Developed by: <strong>Umair Khan</strong> 🚀
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px;">
                🔄 Auto-deploys on every git push | 🐳 Docker Containerized | ☁️ Deployed on Render
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
